Pixel fonts for the "Pixel" text style, from Google Fonts, under the SIL Open Font License 1.1
(see the OFL-*.txt file next to each font). All of them are drawn on an exact pixel grid:
  Micro5-Regular.ttf        Micro 5          11 px per em
  PressStart2P-Regular.ttf  Press Start 2P    8 px per em
  Silkscreen-Regular.ttf    Silkscreen        8 px per em
  Jacquard12-Regular.ttf    Jacquard 12      21 px per em
